# Team Avatar: "Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, it gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of creatures
# you control." In turn 3 Bot1 (two Ornithopters) attacks with one of them: X is 2, Bot2's own Ornithopter not counted, so the
# 0/2 hits for 2 (Bot2 20 -> 18). The pump lasts until end of turn (CR 611.2a): in turn 5 the Ornithopter is 0/2 again in
# Main1, and attacking with both triggers nothing (CR 506.5), so Bot2 stays at 18. Team Avatar's discard ability does not work
# from the battlefield (CR 602.2: it is a hand-only ability).

